+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+No transport compression codec is currently recorded as a project decision. This repository's documentation (README.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/doc.md) contains no statement selecting, mandating, or endorsing a specific compression codec for transport; the only related references are to third-party, community-contributed middleware (e.g. gin-contrib) that may offer compression as an optional add-on, which is not a recorded project decision.
